{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6b8e0da576a71c1eaacf15533a1bfcd35bc139265f39674e4b421aabe1c16df4", "ja": "（風花達と訪れた温泉郷でのライブは大成功。\n昨日は温泉も楽しめたし、いい遠征だったな！）", "zh": "（跟风花她们来温泉乡举办的演唱会非常成功。\n昨天也有充分享受温泉，这场远征真棒！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "44f133e9039ee349c72a645967454983f4b6a4fb2b86a1778972cd17b1a5aa65", "ja": "はあ……。\n失敗しちゃったなぁ……。", "zh": "唉……\n搞砸了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f68ec587985342770c0df690258dc0d97f6b3deb720f202089438426b2bf8903", "ja": "おはよう風花。昨日はだいぶ疲れてたみたい\nだけど、あの後、ちゃんと眠れたか？", "zh": "早安，风花。\n你昨天好像很累的样子，在那之后睡得还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "595e9a3da9be2d8f10f63ff819a183cc8828b3c691431fd0c7d7becb8b6b6222", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！？\nそ、その……昨日は、すみませんでした！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！？\n那、那个……昨天真不好意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "19f0b96e0b10f3b3723ed59746f9b6eef19d4a9df99d555142e867b3eb566e87", "ja": "せっかく、お部屋でライブのお疲れ様会を\nしてもらってたのに、私……。", "zh": "你特地在房间帮我举行演唱会的慰劳会，\n但我却……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7ceed4f5241eb8e83e9955d6a445c60e0950d6bb59e72df7abc6dfc0c93eae02", "ja": "うう、{$P$}さんの前で、\n寝ちゃうなんて～！", "zh": "呜呜，我竟然在{$P$}先生\n面前不小心睡着了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c12c8b7b5abd8cd4947f8ae72d095b1c97e380bdf62ed23268a72c6aa828df00", "ja": "あ、いや、俺の方こそゴメンな。\nすぐに起こしてやれれば良かったんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，不会啦，我才要说抱歉。\n应该马上把你叫起来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1007_p", "source_sha256": "910535809ab1359a050d492deafc71c7c7c6a9fe126501930c0c6d5441b4f36d", "ja": "同じタイミングでうとうとしちゃって……。\n15分くらい、二人して寝ちゃったんだよな。", "zh": "不过我那时也不小心打起瞌睡……\n我们两个大概都睡了15分钟左右吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f93180bb1f2fbc41cdb8451adfa47b4e06becc12bac73c3f2047c3c1c259cd13", "ja": "まあ……、お互い疲れてたんだよ。たぶん！", "zh": "嗯……因为我们都累了吧，大概！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "149898da7cf1b3dde7fe4543d3af5172bfb5b715cb5e58945d470d9129681f29", "ja": "そ、そうですね……。\nお風呂上がりで、身体もポカポカしてたし……。", "zh": "说、说得也是……\n毕竟那时刚泡完澡，身体还暖暖的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4fe596f982497ec3a4b46e3f0f4c518235bf34117d037d095646c7576906eb05", "ja": "それで、体調は大丈夫か？　自分の部屋に戻って\nもらったけど、ちゃんと布団に入って寝たのか？", "zh": "那你的身体还好吗？\n昨天回房间后，有没有好好盖上被子睡觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "73c42402e003b6f2c844360d7f19385230e0b657041f8a950875ff5dc76745de", "ja": "は、はい。\nそれは大丈夫……ですけど……。", "zh": "有、有的。\n这个部分倒是……没有问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "99c2045349e6a7288688bcb671da643d2d2a4b4143a2b7e870b84027f93d6cbd", "ja": "あのっ、私、みっともない所を見せてませんか？\n寝相が悪かったりとか、浴衣がずれたりとかっ！", "zh": "请问，我有没有在你面前露出什么糗样？\n像是奇怪的睡姿，或浴衣松开之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1013_p", "source_sha256": "541c9dd875ef75d99fb8667be670c2c9dcc713b95a5bd99fc4aef7295c36c583", "ja": "えっと……。", "zh": "我想想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "99b5c7bc971b869c055437ffb479cbdf32dfb4d6dfe9001e05857fb129e34f49", "ja": "見せてたんですかぁっ！？", "zh": "难道有吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d1de867e913c8daa42a01e58dfdd812fcc12d4446ab8e5669066245ecdca6b75", "ja": "いや、それは大丈夫！　だと思う！\nちょっと、無防備に寝てたくらいで……。", "zh": "不，没有啦！应该吧！\n你只是睡得有点没警戒心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d49553a2d52ef604279415489be24c51cd26680d0d38f60bc829c7fc1cc66cd4", "ja": "む、無防備って……。\nもしかして、す……裾が……っ！？", "zh": "没、没警戒心……\n难不成我浴衣的下、下摆它……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1017_p", "source_sha256": "80368689a1018082bd6b19e8f6edd36b24d92c1e3a76288873cc2d6c69d77f23", "ja": "いやいやいや、本当に大丈夫だから！\nあ、でも、次からは気をつけような。お互いに。", "zh": "不不不，你真的没露出什么糗态啦！\n啊，不过，往后还是多注意一点好了……我们彼此都是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9fc3d7bf891fa6630df1a725ef6e96ccaf79daf7ed5fd182f9144fe4b675d554", "ja": "は、はい…。一瞬でも、{$P$}さんと\n同じ部屋で寝ちゃうなんて……同じ部屋……。", "zh": "好、好的……我竟然跟{$P$}先生在\n同一个房间睡着了，尽管只有一下子……同一个房间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d3ab982c8afceedcf983d2a6587c07091e970cc751cb3f1582cad09b09b63614", "ja": "ううう、やっぱりダメ～！　話してるだけで、\nどんどん恥ずかしくなってきちゃって、私……！", "zh": "呜呜呜，还是不行～！光是面对面说话，\n就让我越来越难为情了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c5666f6e44462e133b3670a3ea68eafa208deb54b25b7ddfeb7e92156b3a39e8", "ja": "あの、ちょっと風に当たって\n頭を冷やしてきますねっ！", "zh": "那个，我去外面吹一下风，\n让脑袋冷静一下喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0083_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a03885c7bad1fe7eeb866900a548be2bdccdec557a11280d615e60b3590f9d4e", "ja": "あっ、風花！　そろそろ出発しないと、\n帰りの電車が……！", "zh": "啊，风花！差不多该出发了，\n不然会搭不上回程的电车……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
